# ai_fleet_skills — publish surface hygiene.
# Rationale: this repo publishes skill TEXT + runtime. Build artefacts and editor
# backups are not skills; when committed they inflate the manifest fingerprint and
# make package_sha churn without any contract change.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# AGENTS.md.<timestamp>.bak — produced by the AGENTS rewrite path, never consumed.
*.bak

# Agent skill surfaces — junctions into _skill/fleet-skills (agent-surfaces.json)
.cursor/skills/
.claude/skills/
.agents/skills/
